    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293-a1">

                <pb facs="0753" n="667" xml:id="pg667"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure A.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lafragua to Mr.
                            Nelson.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-04-12"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 12,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a copy of a
                    communication addressed me by the war department in reply to one which I had
                    sent to that department concerning the complaints of cattle-stealing in Texas
                    made in a note from your excellency.</p>
                <p>I renew to your excellency the assurance of my attentive consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. M. LAFRAGUA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
